uipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,33,79,84,78,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,33,79,84,78,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,33,79,84,78,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,33,79,84,78,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1019","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[34,33,79,84,78,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10011","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[34,33,79,84,78,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"刘备的核心幕僚。早在刘备领徐州牧时便追随刘备，与糜竺、简雍等人跟随刘备流亡四方。建安五年（200年），孙乾出使袁绍，成功说服其接纳刘备。建安六年（201年），与麋竺出使荆州，以“唇亡齿寒”之理说服刘表接纳刘备。刘备入蜀后，孙乾被拜为秉忠将军，协助制定《蜀科》，但不久后病逝。","tc":"劉備的核心幕僚。早在劉備領徐州牧時便追隨劉備，與糜竺、簡雍等人跟隨劉備流亡四方。建安五年（200年），孫乾出使袁紹，成功說服其接納劉備。建安六年（201年），與麋竺出使荊州，以“唇亡齒寒”之理說服劉表接納劉備。劉備入蜀后，孫乾被拜為秉忠將軍，協助制定《蜀科》，但不久后病逝。","en":"A core member of Liu Bei's retinue. He followed Liu Bei from the time Liu Bei served as Governor of Xu Province, wandering through adversity alongside Mi Zhu, Jian Yong, and others. In the fifth year of Jian'an (200), Sun Qian was sent to Yuan Shao and successfully persuaded him to shelter Liu Bei. In the sixth year of Jian'an (201), he and Mi Zhu were dispatched to Jing Province, where they convinced Liu Biao to take in Liu Bei by arguing that ‘if the lips perish, the teeth will grow cold.’ After Liu Bei entered Shu, Sun Qian was appointed General of Loyal Sincerity and helped draft the Shu Legal Code, but passed away not long after.","jp":"劉備の腹心の幕僚。早くも劉備が徐州牧を領した頃から仕え、麋竺や簡雍らと共に劉備の流亡に付き従った。建安5年（200年）、使者として袁紹の元へ赴き、説得して劉備を受け入れさせることに成功した。建安6年（201年）には麋竺と共に荊州へ赴き、「唇亡びて歯寒し」の理をもって劉表を説得し、劉備を受け入れさせた。劉備が蜀に入ると秉忠将軍に任じられ、『蜀科』の制定にも参与したが、間もなく病没した。","kr":"유비의 핵심 참모. 일찍이 유비가 서주목을 맡았을 때부터 그를 섬겼으며, 미축, 간옹 등과 함께 유비를 보좌하며 사방을 전전했다. 건안 5년(200년), 원소에게 사신으로 가 그를 설득하여 유비를 받아들이도록 했다. 건안 6년(201년)에는 미축과 함께 형주로 파견되어 '순망치한(脣亡齒寒)'의 논리로 유표를 설득해 유비를 맞이하게 했다. 유비가 입촉한 뒤 병충장군에 임명되어 《촉과(蜀科)》 제정을 도왔으나, 얼마 지나지 않아 병으로 세상을 떠났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10352","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"乾","nameTc":"乾","nameEn":"Qian","nameJp":"乾","nameKr":"건","nameOther":"","word":"公祐","wordTc":"公祐","wordEn":"Gongy